{"assets":["/statement-assets/f35c32bf4a5b9c5259142b0e512e4a2a9f50b57451ebe9a7e7f5b01a1d6ca40a.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1722","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. L-shapes"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An L-shape is a figure on gridded paper that looks like the first four pictures below. An L-shape contains exactly three shaded cells (denoted by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"*"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), which can be rotated in any way."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/f35c32bf4a5b9c5259142b0e512e4a2a9f50b57451ebe9a7e7f5b01a1d6ca40a.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a rectangular grid. Determine if it contains L-shapes only, where L-shapes can't touch an edge or corner. More formally: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Each shaded cell in the grid is part of exactly one L-shape, and "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" no two L-shapes are adjacent by edge or corner. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, the last two grids in the picture above "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"do not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" satisfy the condition because the two L-shapes touch by corner and edge, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input consists of multiple test cases. The first line contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 100$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n, m \\leq 50$$$) — the number of rows and columns in the grid, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$n$$$ lines follow, each containing $$$m$$$ characters. Each of these characters is either '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"*"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' — an empty cell or a shaded cell, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if the grid is made up of L-shape that don't share edges or corners, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output the answer in any case (for example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will be recognized as a positive answer)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\n6 10\n........**\n.**......*\n..*..*....\n.....**...\n...*.....*\n..**....**\n6 10\n....*...**\n.**......*\n..*..*....\n.....**...\n...*.....*\n..**....**\n3 3\n...\n***\n...\n4 4\n.*..\n**..\n..**\n..*.\n5 4\n.*..\n**..\n....\n..**\n..*.\n3 2\n.*\n**\n*.\n2 3\n*..\n.**\n3 2\n..\n**\n*.\n3 3\n.**\n*.*\n**.\n3 3\n..*\n.**\n..*\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nNO\nNO\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nNO\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1722F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1722/problem/F"}